Why This Is HUGE

Almost nobody does this.

Interviewers LOVE this because it shows:

debugging maturity,
production awareness,
operational engineering.
Resume Signal

“Built observable LLM systems with distributed tracing.”

That line alone is strong.

ill go in this order,
